    coords: [36.88, -1.25],
    name: {
      de: "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka)",
      hu: "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka)",
      ro: "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka)",
      en: "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka)"
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "East African Breweries Limited (EABL), headquartered in the Ruaraka district of Nairobi, operates one of the most massive and technologically advanced beverage manufacturing complexes on the African continent. Founded in 1922 by colonial settlers, the company has expanded explosively, now dominating the regional alcohol market. The Ruaraka site features colossal stainless-steel fermentation tanks, high-speed automated bottling lines, and massive logistics yards. The facility requires immense inputs of local barley, sorghum, and pristine water, deeply integrating the factory into the broader national agricultural sector. As a subsidiary of the global giant Diageo, the plant is a massive contributor to the national treasury through intense excise taxation, making it a highly scrutinized and pivotal entity in the Kenyan economy. Economics K8 — FMCG manufacturing and taxation."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["Founded in 1922 by two colonial settlers, George and Charles Hurst.", "The Ruaraka complex is one of the largest brewing facilities in Africa.", "A subsidiary of the massive multinational beverage conglomerate, Diageo.", "Features highly advanced, high-speed automated bottling and canning lines.", "Sources massive quantities of barley and sorghum from local Kenyan farmers.", "Consistently ranks among the highest corporate taxpayers in the nation.", "Produces the iconic Tusker lager, deeply embedded in Kenyan cultural identity."]
    },
    description: {
      de: "Die Hauptbrauerei eines der größten Getränkehersteller in der Region, ein bedeutender industrieller Akteur.",
      hu: "A régió egyik legnagyobb italgyártójának fő sörfőzdéje, jelentős ipari szereplő.",
      ro: "Fabrica principală de bere a unuia dintre cei mai mari producători de băuturi din regiune, un jucător industrial major.",
      en: "The main brewery of one of the largest beverage manufacturers in the region, a major industrial player."
    },
    facts: {
      de: ["Hauptbrauerei von EABL", "Großer Getränkehersteller"],
      hu: ["Az EABL fő sörfőzdéje", "Nagy italgyártó"],
      ro: ["Fabrica principală EABL", "Producător mare de băuturi"],
      en: ["Main brewery of EABL", "Large beverage manufacturer"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) ist ein bedeutender Industriestandort in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Die Hauptbrauerei eines der größten Getränkehersteller in der Region, ein bedeutender industrieller Akteur. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "Az East African Breweries Limited (EABL) főzdéje a nairobi Ruaraka negyedben nem csupán egy gyár, hanem Kenya ipari büszkesége. Az 1922-ben két testvér által alapított főzde ma a globális Diageo cégcsoport része, és a leghíresebb helyi sörmárka, a Tusker szülőhazája. A gyár gazdasági hatása óriási: a helyi gazdák tízezreitől vásárolnak árpát és cirkot a sörfőzéshez, miközben a cég az ország egyik legnagyobb adófizetője. (Földrajz K6 — élelmiszeripar és belföldi fogyasztás)",
      ro: "East African Breweries Limited (EABL), situată în districtul Ruaraka din Nairobi, este colosul incontestabil al industriei de băuturi alcoolice din Africa de Est. Fabrica este responsabilă pentru producerea legendarei mărci Tusker, berea națională neoficială a Kenyei, dar procesează și alte zeci de branduri extrem de populare de băuturi spirtoase și cidru. Dincolo de porțile sale industriale imense, influența EABL pătrunde profund în mediul rural; compania cumpără sistematic zeci de mii de tone de orz și sorg direct de la peste 60.000 de fermieri independenți din Rift Valley și Nyanza.",
      en: "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) is a notable industrial site in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. The main brewery of one of the largest beverage manufacturers in the region, a major industrial player. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) ist ein bekannter Industriestandort in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka).", "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Kenya legnagyobb és legrégebbi ipari sörfőzdéje (1922)", "A világszerte ismert 'Tusker' sör otthona", "Az árpa és cirok alapanyagot több tízezer helyi kenyai gazdától veszik", "Nairobi Ruaraka ipari negyedében működik, saját víztisztítókkal", "A kenyai államkassza egyik legfőbb társaságiadó-befizetője", "A gyárat egy ikonikus, hatalmas elefántagyar-szobor (Tusker) díszíti"],
      ro: ["EABL a fost fondată în anul 1922 de doi coloniști și frați kenyeni, George și Charles Hurst.", "Elefantul emblematic Tusker a fost ales după ce fondatorul a fost ucis accidental de unul.", "Compania mamă globală Diageo deține pachetul majoritar de acțiuni al gigantului.", "Fabrica de la Ruaraka pompează singură peste 4 milioane de hectolitri anual.", "Berea este fabricată exclusiv din ingrediente provenite direct din Africa de Est.", "Este unul dintre cei mai mari plătitori de taxe corporative către Autoritatea de Venituri din Kenya."],
      en: ["East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) is a well-known industrial site in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka).", "East African Breweries Limited (Ruaraka) forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
