  {
    id: "mombasa-apparel-epz-economic-v2",
    type: "industry",
    parent: "KE-01",
    coords: [39.63, -3.99],
    name: {
      de: "Mombasa Apparel EPZ",
      hu: "Mombasa Apparel EPZ",
      ro: "Mombasa Apparel EPZ",
      en: "Mombasa Apparel EPZ"
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Mombasa Apparel EPZ represents a massive, highly concentrated node of globalization, situated within the industrial outskirts of Kenya's premier port city. Operating under the heavily incentivized Export Processing Zone framework, these sprawling factory complexes are entirely dedicated to high-volume garment manufacturing. The facility imports vast quantities of raw fabric, primarily from Asia, utilizing thousands of local workers operating in massive, frantic sewing lines to assemble finished clothing. The entire output is strictly destined for export, overwhelmingly targeting the United States market under the tariff-free African Growth and Opportunity Act (AGOA). The zone is a critical, labor-intensive economic engine, providing essential wage employment while physically shaping the urban sprawl surrounding the coastal transport corridors. Economics K7 — Garment manufacturing and global supply chains."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["A massive garment assembly complex operating within the Export Processing Zone framework.", "Located strategically near the Port of Mombasa to minimize import/export logistics costs.", "Employs thousands of local workers in highly labor-intensive sewing operations.", "Imports nearly all raw fabrics from Asian textile hubs.", "Exports finished garments almost exclusively to the United States under the AGOA treaty.", "Benefits from substantial government tax holidays and customs exemptions.", "A critical component of Kenya's strategy to boost manufactured industrial exports."]
    },
    description: {
      de: "Eine große Fabrik zur Herstellung von Kleidung in Mombasa, die hauptsächlich für den Export in die USA unter AGOA produziert.",
      hu: "Egy nagy ruházati gyár Mombasában, amely főként az USA-ba exportál az AGOA keretében.",
      ro: "O fabrică mare de îmbrăcăminte din Mombasa, producând în principal pentru export în SUA prin AGOA.",
      en: "A large clothing manufacturing factory in Mombasa, producing mainly for export to the US under AGOA."
    },
    facts: {
      de: ["Bekleidungsherstellung in Mombasa", "Export in die USA"],
      hu: ["Ruházati gyár Mombasában", "Export az USA-ba"],
      ro: ["Fabrică de îmbrăcăminte în Mombasa", "Export către SUA"],
      en: ["Clothing manufacturing in Mombasa", "Export to the US"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Mombasa Apparel EPZ ist ein bedeutender Industriestandort in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Eine große Fabrik zur Herstellung von Kleidung in Mombasa, die hauptsächlich für den Export in die USA unter AGOA produziert. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Mombasa Apparel EPZ ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Mombasa Apparel EPZ a Mtwapa és Changamwe környékén található gigantikus ruházati gyárkomplexum, amely a parti régió egyik legnagyobb munkaadója. A külföldi tulajdonú gyárban több ezer, nagyrészt női varrónő dolgozik szalagszerű rendszerben, ahol híres amerikai és európai márkák számára készítenek nadrágokat, pólókat és sportruházatot. A Mombasa kikötőjének közelsége miatt a kész konténereket azonnal hajóra rakják. Az üzem létfontosságú az amerikai AGOA kereskedelmi egyezmény kihasználásában. (Földrajz K7 — könnyűipar és női foglalkoztatás)",
      ro: "Mombasa Apparel EPZ, parte a unei ramificații gigantice situate în Mtwapa și Kikambala, domină industria de asamblare textilă din zona de coastă a Kenyei. Aici, peste o duzină de hale industriale ticsite cu sute de mașini de cusut ultra-rapide fabrică haine destinate brandurilor mari din Statele Unite și Europa. Datorită proximității excelente față de Portul Mombasa, importul fibrelor și exportul produselor finite se desfășoară cu o viteză maximă și la costuri minime. Zona economică specială absoarbe mii de muncitori necalificați din județele rurale învecinate, contribuind substanțial la eradicarea sărăciei extreme.",
      en: "Mombasa Apparel EPZ is a notable industrial site in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. A large clothing manufacturing factory in Mombasa, producing mainly for export to the US under AGOA. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Mombasa Apparel EPZ offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Mombasa Apparel EPZ ist ein bekannter Industriestandort in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Mombasa Apparel EPZ spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Mombasa Apparel EPZ.", "Mombasa Apparel EPZ ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["A parti tartomány legnagyobb textilipari munkaadója", "Kizárólag exportra termel, főleg az észak-amerikai piacra", "Több mint 10 000 embert foglalkoztat, akiknek 80%-a nő", "Cipzárakat, fonalakat importálnak, és kész ruházatot exportálnak", "A Mombasai kikötő közelsége kritikus a tengeri szállítmányozás miatt", "A globális 'fast fashion' iparág egyik fontos afrikai beszállítója"],
      ro: ["Peste 10.000 de muncitori, predominant femei, lucrează în ture regulate în aceste facilități.", "Majoritatea confecțiilor exportate sunt scutite de taxe vamale americane prin legea AGOA.", "Utilajele funcționează sincronizat pentru asamblarea completă a unei cămăși în doar câteva minute.", "Producătorul este deținut în principal de conglomerate uriașe din India și Sri Lanka.", "Proximitatea față de ocean taie drastic prețul și timpul petrecut pe transportul de tranzit.", "Fabrica impune standarde stricte de muncă stipulate de organizațiile internaționale de audit."],
      en: ["Mombasa Apparel EPZ is a well-known industrial site in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Mombasa Apparel EPZ plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Mombasa Apparel EPZ.", "Mombasa Apparel EPZ forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
