    name: {
      de: "Twiga Chemiefabrik",
      hu: "Twiga Vegyipari Üzem",
      ro: "Fabrica de Produse Chimice Twiga",
      en: "Twiga Chemicals Plant"
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Twiga Chemicals Plant, situated in Nairobi's sprawling Industrial Area, is a highly specialized, historically significant manufacturing facility serving the critical intersection of industry and agriculture. Established in the mid-20th century originally as part of the massive Imperial Chemical Industries (ICI) conglomerate, the plant formulates, blends, and packages a vast array of agrochemicals, industrial explosives, and specialized industrial chemicals. Its massive storage silos and highly regulated blending vats produce the exact pesticides and fertilizers required by Kenya's massive tea, coffee, and floriculture sectors. The facility operates under extremely strict safety and environmental protocols due to the highly volatile and toxic nature of its raw materials, forming a quiet but absolutely essential backbone for the nation's agrarian output. Economics K8 — Agrochemical formulation."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["Historically originated as a subsidiary of the British conglomerate Imperial Chemical Industries (ICI).", "Located in the densely packed Nairobi Industrial Area.", "A premier regional formulator and distributor of specialized agrochemicals.", "Supplies critical pesticides and fertilizers to the massive floriculture and tea sectors.", "Features highly secure, regulated blending and storage facilities for volatile chemicals.", "Also manufactures specialized industrial explosives utilized in the mining sector.", "Operates under extremely strict environmental and industrial safety protocols."]
    },
    description: {
      de: "Ein führender Hersteller und Vertreiber von landwirtschaftlichen Chemikalien und Industriegütern in Kenia.",
      hu: "A mezőgazdasági vegyszerek és ipari cikkek vezető gyártója és forgalmazója Kenyában.",
      ro: "Un producător și distribuitor de top de produse chimice agricole și bunuri industriale din Kenya.",
      en: "A leading manufacturer and distributor of agricultural chemicals and industrial goods in Kenya."
    },
    facts: {
      de: ["Hersteller von Agrarchemikalien", "Industriegüterproduktion"],
      hu: ["Agrárvegyszer gyártó", "Ipari termékek gyártása"],
      ro: ["Producător de produse chimice agricole", "Producția de bunuri industriale"],
      en: ["Manufacturer of agricultural chemicals", "Industrial goods production"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Twiga Chemiefabrik ist ein bedeutender Industriestandort in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Ein führender Hersteller und Vertreiber von landwirtschaftlichen Chemikalien und Industriegütern in Kenia. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Twiga Chemiefabrik ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Twiga Chemicals a nairobi Ipari Zóna egyik legrégebbi és legfontosabb vegyipari létesítménye. A cég eredetileg a brit ICI leányvállalataként indult az 1940-es években, és ma a kenyai mezőgazdaság legfőbb támogatója. A gyárban agrokemikáliákat, rovarölőket, gombaölő szereket és speciális állatgyógyászati termékeket kevernek és csomagolnak. Ezen kívül a robbanóanyag-iparban is jelen vannak a bányászat és kőfejtés számára. (Földrajz K6 — vegyipar és agrokemikáliák)",
      ro: "Fabrica Twiga Chemicals, așezată strategic în Zona Industrială a capitalei Nairobi, este liderul național în furnizarea de soluții esențiale pentru agricultură și industrie. Pe parcursul deceniilor, uzina a formulat și ambalat îngrășăminte de o eficiență superioară, pesticide avansate, explozibili comerciali pentru minerit și substanțe vitale pentru purificarea apei, devenind sângele agricol și industrial al Kenyei. Sectorul de floricultură din regiunea Riftului se bazează exclusiv pe produsele fitosanitare de înaltă precizie ale Twiga, protejând astfel recoltele valoroase de daune provocate de insectele dăunătoare și clima neprielnică.",
      en: "Twiga Chemicals Plant is a notable industrial site in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. A leading manufacturer and distributor of agricultural chemicals and industrial goods in Kenya. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Twiga Chemicals Plant offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Twiga Chemiefabrik ist ein bekannter Industriestandort in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Twiga Chemiefabrik spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Twiga Chemiefabrik.", "Twiga Chemiefabrik ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Kenya egyik legrégebbi mezőgazdasági vegyipari vállalata (1949)", "Növényvédő szerek és műtrágyák formulázását és csomagolását végzi", "A kenyai nagyüzemi farmok és virágkertészetek fő beszállítója", "Polgári robbanóanyagok engedélyezett forgalmazója (bányászat)", "Nairobi hagyományos ipari övezetében (Industrial Area) székel", "A név a 'twiga' (zsiráf) szuahéli szóból származik"],
      ro: ["A fost lansată în anii 1940 ca sucursală locală a faimosului gigant britanic ICI.", "Produce explozibili minieri esențiali pentru extracția titanului și cimentului local.", "Distribuie medicamente vitale de tip veterinar pentru zeci de mii de ferme bovine regionale.", "Dispune de un departament vast dedicat sănătății publice urbane (combaterea malariei).", "A fost complet integrată și achiziționată de un consorțiu antreprenorial din estul Africii.", "Facilitatea aplică un management sever privind siguranța depozitării substanțelor corozive."],
      en: ["Twiga Chemicals Plant is a well-known industrial site in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Twiga Chemicals Plant plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Twiga Chemicals Plant.", "Twiga Chemicals Plant forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/twiga-chemicals-plant-economic-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "kenya-meat-commission-economic-v2",
    type: "industry",
    parent: "KE-16",
    coords: [36.985, -1.455],
    name: {
      de: "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River)",
      hu: "Kenyai Húsipari Bizottság (Athi River)",
      ro: "Comisia Cărnii din Kenya (Athi River)",
      en: "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River)"
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Kenya Meat Commission (KMC) facility in Athi River is a colossal, state-owned abattoir and meat processing complex, historically designed to serve as the absolute terminus for the nation's massive pastoralist livestock economy. Established in 1953 by the colonial administration, the sprawling factory features extensive holding pens, highly automated slaughtering lines, and massive cold-storage warehouses. For decades, it was the premier exporter of Kenyan beef and canned meat (notably corned beef) to Europe and the Middle East. However, the facility suffered severe operational collapse and financial ruin in the late 1990s due to extreme mismanagement. Recently, the factory was dramatically transferred to the control of the Kenya Defence Forces (KDF), triggering a massive, disciplined revitalization of its processing capabilities. Economics K7 — Livestock processing and military management."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["Established by the colonial government in 1953 as the premier national abattoir.", "Located strategically in Athi River, accessible by rail and highway.", "Historically the largest exporter of Kenyan beef and canned meat products.", "Features massive holding pens, mechanized slaughter lines, and cold storage.", "Suffered a catastrophic operational and financial collapse in the late 1990s.", "Dramatically transferred to the management of the Kenya Defence Forces (KDF) in 2020.", "Currently supplies massive quantities of meat to state security agencies."]
    },
    description: {
      de: "Der wichtigste staatliche Fleischverarbeitungsbetrieb in Kenia, der Fleischprodukte für den lokalen und internationalen Markt verarbeitet.",
      hu: "A legfontosabb állami húsfeldolgozó üzem Kenyában, amely hústermékeket dolgoz fel a helyi és a nemzetközi piacra.",
      ro: "Principala unitate de procesare a cărnii de stat din Kenya, procesând produse din carne pentru piața locală și internațională.",
      en: "The premier state-owned meat processing facility in Kenya, processing meat products for the local and international market."
    },
    facts: {
      de: ["Staatlicher Fleischverarbeitungsbetrieb", "Fleischprodukte für In- und Ausland"],
      hu: ["Állami húsfeldolgozó üzem", "Hústermékek bel- és külföldre"],
      ro: ["Unitate de procesare a cărnii de stat", "Produse din carne pentru țară și străinătate"],
      en: ["State meat processing facility", "Meat products for domestic and foreign markets"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) ist ein bedeutender Industriestandort in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Der wichtigste staatliche Fleischverarbeitungsbetrieb in Kenia, der Fleischprodukte für den lokalen und internationalen Markt verarbeitet. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Kenya Meat Commission (KMC) központi vágóhídja Athi River városában található, és az ország legnagyobb húsfeldolgozó üzeme. A gyarmati időkben épült gyár célja a hatalmas nomád pásztor-területek (Maszájföld, Észak-Kenya) szarvasmarháinak felvásárlása és feldolgozása volt. Bár a vállalat évtizedekig pénzügyi nehézségekkel és bezárásokkal küzdött, a Kenyai Védelmi Erők (KDF) nemrég átvették az irányítását, modernizálták a gépsorokat, és újraindították a magas minőségű hús- és konzervgyártást a hadsereg és a belföldi piac számára. (Földrajz K7 — élelmiszerbiztonság és állattenyésztés)",
      ro: "Fabrica Kenya Meat Commission (KMC) de la Athi River este coloana vertebrală istorică a abatoarelor și procesării industriale de carne de vită din inima Kenyei. Fondată de administrația colonială pentru a valorifica milioanele de vite crescute de triburile pastorale Maasai și Samburu, uriașa uzină produce faimoasele conserve din carne de vită \"Corned Beef\", exportate către trupele militare și piețele internaționale din Orientul Mijlociu. De curând, pentru a redresa un declin profund cauzat de gestiunea necorespunzătoare istorică, guvernul a predat cu succes administrarea complexului direct Forțelor de Apărare din Kenya.",
      en: "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) is a notable industrial site in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. The premier state-owned meat processing facility in Kenya, processing meat products for the local and international market. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) ist ein bekannter Industriestandort in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River).", "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Afrika egyik legnagyobb múltú, állami tulajdonú vágóhídja", "Athi River városában működik, közel a fő pásztor-területekhez", "Évtizedes hanyatlás után a Kenyai Védelmi Erők (KDF) vették át a menedzsmentjét", "Kapacitása eléri a napi 1000 szarvasmarha feldolgozását", "A híres 'Corned Beef' (sózott marhahús) konzervek fő gyártója", "Biztos piacot jelent a szárazságtól sújtott nomád állattartóknak"],
      ro: ["Fabrica a fost inaugurată în anul 1953 ca instituție guvernamentală de monopol.", "Armata kenyană (KDF) a preluat managementul total și paza unității la finalul anului 2020.", "Este capabilă, oficial, să sacrifice și să proceseze o mie de bovine mari pe zi.", "Produsele conservate rezistă mulți ani și sunt preferate de soldați și în tabere de refugiați.", "Susține stabilizarea financiară preluând mii de animale slăbite în timpul secetelor prelungite.", "Pielea, coarnele și sângele vitelor sunt complet procesate în îngrășăminte și clei organic."],
      en: ["Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) is a well-known industrial site in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River).", "Kenya Meat Commission (Athi River) forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/kenya-meat-commission-economic-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "brooksides-dairy-processing-economic-v2",
    type: "industry",
    parent: "KE-22",
    coords: [36.955, -1.14],
    name: {
      de: "Brookside Molkerei Ruiru",
      hu: "Brookside Tejfeldolgozó Ruiru",
      ro: "Fabrica de Lactate Brookside Ruiru",
      en: "Brookside Dairy Processing Ruiru"
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Brookside Dairy Processing plant in Ruiru is a colossal, hyper-modern agro-industrial complex, functioning as the absolute nerve center of East Africa's largest dairy corporation. Situated in Kiambu County, the massive facility collects hundreds of thousands of liters of raw milk daily from a vast network of over 100,000 smallholder farmers across the country. The factory utilizes highly advanced, automated pasteurization, ultra-high temperature (UHT) processing, and packaging lines to produce a wide array of dairy products with extended shelf lives. This massive industrial capacity has fundamentally transformed the local agricultural landscape, guaranteeing a market for rural dairy farmers while supplying supermarkets across the entire East African region. The sheer scale of its cold-chain logistics is a marvel of modern regional distribution. Economics K7 — Dairy industrialization."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["The largest and most technologically advanced dairy processing facility in East Africa.", "Located in the rapidly industrializing town of Ruiru in Kiambu County.", "Collects raw milk from a massive network of over 100,000 smallholder farmers daily.", "Features state-of-the-art Ultra-High Temperature (UHT) processing and packaging lines.", "A highly dominant market player, acquiring numerous smaller regional dairies over the years.", "Operates a massive, highly synchronized national cold-chain logistics network.", "Exports processed dairy products extensively across the East African region."]
    },
    description: {
      de: "Einer der größten Milchverarbeitungsbetriebe Ostafrikas, der Milchprodukte in der gesamten Region vertreibt.",
      hu: "Kelet-Afrika egyik legnagyobb tejfeldolgozó üzeme, amely tejtermékeket forgalmaz az egész régióban.",
      ro: "Una dintre cele mai mari unități de procesare a lactatelor din Africa de Est, distribuind produse lactate în întreaga regiune.",
      en: "One of East Africa's largest dairy processing plants, distributing dairy products across the region."
    },
    facts: {
      de: ["Großer Milchverarbeitungsbetrieb", "Vertrieb in ganz Ostafrika"],
      hu: ["Nagy tejfeldolgozó üzem", "Forgalmazás egész Kelet-Afrikában"],
      ro: ["Unitate mare de procesare a lactatelor", "Distribuție în toată Africa de Est"],
      en: ["Large dairy processing plant", "Distribution throughout East Africa"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Brookside Molkerei Ruiru ist ein bedeutender Industriestandort in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Einer der größten Milchverarbeitungsbetriebe Ostafrikas, der Milchprodukte in der gesamten Region vertreibt. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Brookside Molkerei Ruiru ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Brookside Dairy Ruiruban található központi üzeme Kelet-Afrika legnagyobb tejfeldolgozó létesítménye. A cég naponta több mint egymillió liter nyerstejet vásárol fel a Kenya-szerte működő tízezernyi kistermelőtől (akik gyakran csak 1-2 tehenet tartanak). A hatalmas gyárkomplexumban a legmodernebb technológiával állítanak elő UHT tejet, joghurtot, vajat és tejport. A vállalat uralja a kenyai tejpiacot, és a környező országokba is exportál, stabil jövedelmet biztosítva a vidéki farmereknek. (Földrajz K6 — tejipar és kistermelői integráció)",
      ro: "Brookside Dairy, situată la marginea pitorescului oraș Ruiru din județul Kiambu, se ridică drept cel mai falnic și avansat complex de prelucrare a lactatelor de pe continentul est-african. Fondată de familia președintelui fondator, gigantul privat colectează litri imenși de lapte nepasteurizat direct de la un lanț formidabil ce numără peste 200.000 de gospodării de mici fermieri independenți de-a lungul întregului platou central. Instalațiile robotizate sterilizează, omogenizează și ambalează în tetra-pack o multitudine de variante: de la laptele ultra-pasteurizat de lungă durată până la smântână bogată și iaurturi delicioase cu arome tropicale.",
      en: "Brookside Dairy Processing Ruiru is a notable industrial site in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. One of East Africa's largest dairy processing plants, distributing dairy products across the region. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Brookside Dairy Processing Ruiru offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Brookside Molkerei Ruiru ist ein bekannter Industriestandort in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Brookside Molkerei Ruiru spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Brookside Molkerei Ruiru.", "Brookside Molkerei Ruiru ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Kelet- és Közép-Afrika legnagyobb napi kapacitású tejüzeme", "Nairobitól északra, a Thika-autópálya melletti Ruiru városban fekszik", "Több mint 200 000 kisüzemi tehenészettel áll beszállítói kapcsolatban", "Az országos tejpiac (friss és UHT tej) közel felét uralja", "Ultramodern pasztörizáló és csomagoló gépsorokkal rendelkezik", "A vállalat részben a Danone (francia multi) tulajdonában van"],
      ro: ["Este cel mai dominant brand de lapte de pe piața națională de retail kenyană.", "Danone, un lider multinațional european francez, deține participații substanțiale în companie.", "Deține capacitatea excepțională de a prelucra peste 1,5 milioane de litri zilnic.", "Fermierilor li se asigură credite bancare avantajoase și cursuri gratuite de nutriție animală.", "Produsele se exportă masiv pe piața liberă din Tanzania, Rwanda, Uganda și Somalia.", "Instalația sa termică este una dintre cele mai curate din sector, utilizând biomasă agricolă."],
      en: ["Brookside Dairy Processing Ruiru is a well-known industrial site in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Brookside Dairy Processing Ruiru plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Brookside Dairy Processing Ruiru.", "Brookside Dairy Processing Ruiru forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/brooksides-dairy-processing-economic-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "base-titanium-port-facility-economic-v2",
    type: "port",
    parent: "KE-01",
    coords: [39.635, -4.09],
    name: {
      de: "Base Titanium Verladeanlage Likoni",
      hu: "Base Titanium Rakodóterminál Likoni",
      ro: "Terminalul de Încărcare Base Titanium Likoni",
      en: "Base Titanium Loading Facility Likoni"
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Base Titanium Loading Facility at Likoni is a massive, highly specialized proprietary marine terminal explicitly constructed to export the mineral wealth extracted from the nearby Kwale Titanium Mine. Completed in 2013, the facility represents a brutal, highly efficient imposition of heavy industry onto the coastal landscape. Processed heavy minerals—rutile, ilmenite, and zircon—are trucked from the inland mine and stored in colossal, climate-controlled silos situated directly on the shoreline. A massive, high-capacity conveyor belt system extends over the water, loading bulk carrier ships at staggering speeds. This dedicated infrastructure totally bypasses the congestion of the main Mombasa port, ensuring seamless, high-volume mineral exports directly to global pigment and metallurgy markets, primarily in China and the US. Economics K8 — Proprietary bulk export infrastructure."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["A highly specialized proprietary marine export terminal built at Likoni.", "Constructed specifically to export output from the Kwale Titanium Mine.", "Features massive onshore storage silos for rutile, ilmenite, and zircon.", "Utilizes a massive, high-speed automated conveyor system to load bulk carrier vessels.", "Allows the mining corporation to completely bypass the congested Port of Mombasa.", "Represents a multi-million-dollar investment in dedicated heavy export infrastructure.", "Primarily exports heavy mineral sands to industrial markets in China and the USA."]
    },
    description: {
      de: "Eine spezielle Hafenanlage zum Export von Mineralsanden, die in Kwale abgebaut werden.",
      hu: "Egy speciális kikötői létesítmény a Kwale-ben bányászott ásványi homok exportálására.",
      ro: "O instalație portuară specializată pentru exportul de nisipuri minerale exploatate în Kwale.",
      en: "A specialized port facility for exporting mineral sands mined in Kwale."
    },
    facts: {
      de: ["Spezielle Hafenanlage", "Export von Mineralsanden"],
      hu: ["Speciális kikötői létesítmény", "Ásványi homok exportja"],
      ro: ["Instalație portuară specializată", "Export de nisipuri minerale"],
      en: ["Specialized port facility", "Export of mineral sands"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Base Titanium Verladeanlage Likoni ist ein bedeutender Hafen in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Eine spezielle Hafenanlage zum Export von Mineralsanden, die in Kwale abgebaut werden. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Base Titanium Verladeanlage Likoni ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Base Titanium Mombasától délre, Likoniban működő tengeri rakodóterminálja a Kwale titánbánya exportkapuja. Ez a magántulajdonban lévő, speciálisan kialakított létesítmény lehetővé teszi, hogy a bányából teherautókon érkező hatalmas mennyiségű ásványi homokot (rutil, ilmenit) zárt tárolókból, hatalmas futószalagokon keresztül, közvetlenül a tengerjáró teherhajók gyomrába öntsék. A technológia rendkívül gyors és pormentes, biztosítva a hatékony exportot anélkül, hogy a közeli turisztikai strandokat szennyeznék. (Földrajz K7 — export logisztika és nyersanyagok)",
      ro: "Facilitatea portuară Base Titanium din extremitatea peninsulei Likoni din Mombasa, este un miracol exclusiv de logistică industrială construit pentru un singur scop: exportul mineralelor prețioase. Legată direct de mina din județul Kwale printr-o vastă magistrală asfaltată privată de zeci de kilometri, această dană maritimă funcționează complet izolat de haosul portului comercial de stat. Nave oceanice masive sunt încărcate printr-un sistem uriaș de benzi transportoare acoperite care varsă în vrac mii de tone de rutil și ilmenit pe oră, asigurând un tranzit fulgerător către destinațiile sale asiatice și nord-americane.",
      en: "Base Titanium Loading Facility Likoni is a notable port in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. A specialized port facility for exporting mineral sands mined in Kwale. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Base Titanium Loading Facility Likoni offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Base Titanium Verladeanlage Likoni ist ein bekannter Hafen in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Base Titanium Verladeanlage Likoni spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Base Titanium Verladeanlage Likoni.", "Base Titanium Verladeanlage Likoni ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Saját, magán üzemeltetésű rakodóterminál a Likoni csatorna bejáratánál", "A Kwale bányából kitermelt ásványi homokot rakodja hajókra", "Folyamatos, zárt szállítószalag-rendszer akadályozza meg a porképződést", "Képes óránként 1000 tonna ásványt a hajók gyomrába juttatni", "Tehermentesíti a fő Mombasai kikötőt az ömlesztett rakományoktól", "Az itt megrakott hajók főként Ázsiába és a Közel-Keletre tartanak"],
      ro: ["Dana privată de export a costat peste 30 de milioane de dolari pentru a fi perfect asamblată.", "Are capacitatea unică de a primi simultan nave cargo având tonaje nete de peste 35.000 de tone.", "Benzile de încărcare speciale generează zero emisii de praf protejând astfel complet marea din jur.", "Navele părăsesc portul privat cu destinații industriale finale majore spre Statele Unite sau China.", "Terenul terminalului acoperă facilități uriașe subterane de stocare perfect uscată a minereului fragil.", "Construcția ei a ușurat un ambuteiaj colosal care ar fi paralizat traficul intern local din Likoni."],
      en: ["Base Titanium Loading Facility Likoni is a well-known port in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Base Titanium Loading Facility Likoni plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Base Titanium Loading Facility Likoni.", "Base Titanium Loading Facility Likoni forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/base-titanium-port-facility-economic-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "pepsi-cola-plant-ruaraka-economic-v2",
    type: "industry",
    parent: "KE-47",
    coords: [36.885, -1.245],
    name: {
      de: "Pepsi-Abfüllanlage Ruaraka",
      hu: "Pepsi Palackozóüzem Ruaraka",
      ro: "Fabrica de Îmbuteliere Pepsi Ruaraka",
      en: "Pepsi Bottling Plant Ruaraka"
